WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.340
Go! Titanic Dive!!

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:08.100
Anna!

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.310
Boy, it's your turn next.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.190
Direct Attack Yuma Tsukumo!

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.610
Yuma-<i>kun</i> only has 3100 Life left.

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:25.070
And he's faced against Gangaridia's 3400 Attack Points!

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.160
If he takes that attack, Yuma will...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.830
Without a Monster on my field,
 I can't use my set card, Half Unbreak.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:36.660
That means...

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.250
No, we still have a move.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:39.630
Huh?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.600
This is goodbye, boy!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.410
Yuma!

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.500
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:05.470
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.180
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.530
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.610
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:28.120
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.490
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.710
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:38.250
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.380
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:43.090
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.550
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:48.600
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.060
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:57.100
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.860
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.320
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:06.030
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:15.080
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:30.460
That's it! Trap, activate! Half Unbreak!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:36.420
This card negates the destruction of one Monster and halves the Battle Damage!

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:37.260
"Devoted Love: Yuma, I've Entrusted You With My Last Draw!!"

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.470
Wait! But you don't have a Monster...!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:45.720
Yeah, that's right! That's why I'm using Half Unbreak to target...

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.560
Gangaridia!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:49.730
What?!

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.150
The opponent's Monster?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.150
3400 Attack Points...

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.490
Even halved, I still felt it...!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:04.450
Yuma.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.910
What's going on here?

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:13.380
Half Unbreak normally protects your own Monster from being destroyed during an attack,

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.880
and the card negates your Battle Damage.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.720
But he didn't have a Monster on the field.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.720
That's why he targeted his enemy's Gangaridia to activate it

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:28.350
and only used the part of the effect to halve the damage to his Life, right?

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.350
Goodness. What a boy.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.150
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.070
Here goes! My turn! Draw!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.610
I Summon Dododo Warrior!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:49.330
I can reduce this card's Attack Power by 500 in order to Summon it without release!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.290
Continuing, I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Reception!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:58.340
When there's an Xyz Monster on the opponent's card on the field

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.050
this card lets me Special Summon a Monster from my hand with the same level

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.890
as a Monster I currently control on the field!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.930
Come out, Chachaka Archer!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.350
However, the Monster Special Summoned by this card

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.150
has their Attack and Defense Power reduced to zero, and their effects negated!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.570
He's got two Level Six Monsters.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.110
Here he comes, Darling.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:27.910
I Overlay the Level Six Dododo Warrior and Chachaka Archer!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.370
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.620
Xyz Summon!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:40.210
With the spirit of your passion,
 aim for your target! Gauntlet Shooter!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.260
The heck? A Rank <i>Six</i>?

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.430
My Gustav Max is a Rank <i>Ten</i>, you know!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.970
And <i>yours</i> got taken out!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.470
What'd you say?!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.440
Stop your babbling and get on with it already!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.440
Yuma, now is not the time for the useless bickering.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:04:59.860
Right...

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.780
I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Treasure!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.910
It lets me draw a card one card for each Xyz Monster on the field!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.200
There's two Xyz Monsters on the field!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.620
So I can draw two cards!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.500
Then I activate Gauntlet Shooter's effect!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.010
I detach one Overlay Unit to destroy one Monster on the field!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.970
Yes! Now he can beat Gangaridia!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.680
Shoot it down, Gauntlet Shooter!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.520
Aim for Super-colossal Sky Palace Gangaridia!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.560
Trap, activate! Xyz Coat!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:43.940
This card prevents one Monster from being destroyed by battle or card effects for the duration of this turn!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.660
Now Gangaridia's destruction is negated.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.320
Too bad~~

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.080
You saved me, Honey!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.250
Gangaridia represents the love we share, Darling!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.080
So it's only natural that I'd protect it.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.260
My attack's not over yet!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.720
Gauntlet Shooter, Direct Attack Pro Umimi!

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.310
Trap, activate! Xyz Move!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:17.850
this card lets me shift control of one Monster I control to my ally,

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.520
and ends the battle!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.610
Gauntlet Shooter's attack was...!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.320
You saved me, Darling!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.700
Protecting you is my role.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:29.860
Darling!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.740
Wow~! So lovely~!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.750
They have superb combination that
 responds directly to the opponent.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.040
Darn! I set one card and end my-

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.790
Just wait a minute!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.000
Trap, activate! Grade Up!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.630
This card can be activated by releasing one Xyz Monster!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.680
I release Gauntlet Shooter!

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:59.480
And I can Special Summon one Xyz Monster from my Graveyard!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:04.730
Come out! Superdreadnought Rail Cannon Gustav Max!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:09.820
And thanks to Grade Up's effect, it gains 600 Attack Points!

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:15.660
What now?! Now it's got more Attack Points than Gangaridia!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.870
On top of that, the Monster Special Summoned through this effect

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.790
can't be destroyed by card effects!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.000
Anna! You went and took my Monster again!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.170
Because your gauntlet Shooter couldn't beat Gangaridia, right?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:32.720
Just wait a minute! I also got tac... tac...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.140
<i>Tactics</i>.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.060
Right! I got tactics!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:39.430
What's with that? You can't survive like that.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:43.270
Anyway, just stop your whining and leave this to me!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.150
I can't trust you with this!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:48.650
<i>Anna-</i>chan<i>, you don't understand at all...</i>

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.030
<i>Only by clashing all your feelings against each other in a Duel...</i>

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.280
<i>...can one heart meet another head on.</i>

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:59.830
<i>I Dueled numerous times, and with Tobio-</i>san<i>...</i>

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.790
<i>Back when I taught Anna-</i>chan<i> how to Duel,</i>

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:10.760
<i>I Dueled with you so much because I thought it would allow us to connect our hearts.</i>

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:17.350
<i>Yes, I even sacrificed that card for you</i>

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.140
<i>hoping you would meet a knight of your own</i>

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.270
<i>and play a Tag Duel not just literally, but in life!</i>

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.480
<i>But... But as you are now, Anna-</i>chan<i>...</i>

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.860
Anyway, you went and used my Monster like that!

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.490
It's fine! It's in the rules, after all!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.660
I end my turn here!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.170
My turn! Draw!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:53.760
<i>Anna... You don't understand anything...
 And if that's so...</i>

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.430
I'll <i>make</i> you understand!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.850
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.730
Barian's Force?!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.690
Then she's being controlled by Barian?!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:09.400
No way!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.740
Yuma, we can't afford to lose this Duel!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:14.700
Yeah!

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.620
Honey... What's that on your forehead?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:21.080
And when did you add that Magic Card in your deck?!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:25.960
This card Ranks Up my Xyz Monster

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.420
and Special Summons a Chaos Xyz!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.300
I Overlay the Level Ten Gangaridia!

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:36.510
I use this one Monster to rebuild the Overlay Unit!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.600
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.890
With the power of Barian born from chaos,

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.900
the Palace of Love shall now be born!

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:53.900
Show yourself, Chaos Xyz:
 Super-colossal Flying Fortress Babylon!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:58.660
What in the world is...?!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.830
What <i>is</i> this Monster?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.620
I activate Babylon's effect!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:09.580
I detach two Chaos Overlay Units
 so it can attack up to twice per turn!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.920
Multiple Rusher!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.670
This isn't good, Yuma. Anna only has 2000 Life Points remaining.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.840
If she destroys Gustav Max,

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.050
and then attacks her directly,

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.550
she will be finished!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.560
Prepare yourself!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.060
I attack Gustav with Babylon!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.980
Destiny Buster!!

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.360
Trap, activate! Reverse Glasses!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:41.070
This card halves the Attack Power of all Monsters on the field until the end of the turn!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.550
Yuma, why are you doing that for me?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.760
Why? Isn't it natural to protect your Tag Partner?

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.760
You went and did something really annoying!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.470
In that case, I activate Babylon's effect!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.680
When the opponent's Monster is destroyed in battle,

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.270
you take damage equal to half that Monster's Attack Power!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.520
Take 900 points of damage!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.940
Secondary Disaster!

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.320
Anna!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.580
It isn't over yet. I can still attack again!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.170
This will end it! Babylon Direct Attacks!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.420
I Direct Attack with Babylon!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.180
I Special Summon Gentlooper from my hand!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.720
When my opponent is attacked,

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.270
I can Special Summon this Monster from my hand!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.900
And when Gentlooper is on the field,

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.820
the opponent's Monster can only attack Gentlooper!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.780
It's so <i>touching</i> that you'd
 use yourself as a shield for your partner!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.990
I activate Babylon's effect!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.120
You take half the Attack Power of the destroyed Monster as damage!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.460
Secondary Disaster!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.710
Yuma!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.340
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.760
Now the effect of Reverse Glasses disappears!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.230
My turn...! Draw!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.150
I'll Summon Thuggish Limited Express - Battrain!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.830
I'll Direct Attack Pro Tobio!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.750
Trap, activate! Xyz Move!

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:01.210
This card's effect gives control of Babylon to Tobio-<i>san</i>!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.010
Then the battle ends!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.470
Even if she's under the control of Barian,

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.890
their combination remains the same, huh?

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:13.600
Shit! In that case, I activate Battrain's effect!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.560
It can inflict 500 points of damage on my opponent once per turn!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.730
Train Lane!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.990
Useless struggle...!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:28.570
Hey, do you know what they call this?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.750
"As useless as pouring water on a hot stone."

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.120
Just take a good look at your partner!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:40.090
The poor thing looks like he's 
on the verge of falling over any second!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.420
He used up his hand trying to protect you,

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.300
and he has no Defense Monster!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.300
Watch closely.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:53.720
Next turn, your partner will fall 
cruelly before the formation of our love!

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:57.980
He'll be thoroughly crushed until there's nothing left!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.520
H-Hey, Honey! You don't need to put it that way...

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.610
You shut your mouth, Darling!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:08.910
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:14.080
I set one card and end my turn!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.410
My turn! Draw!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.590
Darling! Show them the power of our love!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:22.920
Y-Yeah...

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:27.260
I detach one Overlay Unit

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.010
and activate Babylon's effect!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.840
Multiple Rusher!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.640
Then I Direct Attack the boy!

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.350
If this keeps up, Yuma-<i>kun</i> will...!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:50.660
<i>You may not understand right now, but you'll get the meaning of that card some day.</i>

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.120
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Devoted Love!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.210
Huh?! Love?!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:05.840
Until the end of this turn, in exchange for reducing my Life to zero,

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:09.340
this card ends the battle and lets my opponent draw one card!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:14.600
Anna...

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:16.560
You...

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:18.810
Yuma!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.980
You're the one who'll draw a card!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.230
Yuma!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.030
Right!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.240
I'm gonna bring it to 'em! Draw!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.990
Looks like he drew a good card.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.330
I'll end my turn there.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.430
Anna!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:54.800
Yuma...

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.220
I'll leave the rest up to you.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.060
Anna...

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:01.560
Yuma.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.940
What was the card you drew just now?

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.900
Why are you holding a Barian card?

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.860
U-Uh... Well...

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.490
I took it from Gilag!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.950
I got it from defeating him.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.870
But why is a card like that in your deck...?!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.250
W-Well, you see...

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.460
A-Anyway, focus on the Duel now!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.710
My turn! Draw!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.300
I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:38.350
Anna! I won't let your Monster go to waste!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:43.190
I Overlay the Level Four Gagaga Magician and Battrain!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.860
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.650
Xyz Summon!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:56.200
Come out, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.330
<i>Hope has 2500 Attack Points.</i>

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.250
<i>He doesn't stand a chance against Babylon like this.</i>

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.000
<i>In that case...</i>

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.670
<i>Yuma, don't tell me you want to use that card!</i>

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:19.180
Astral, even if it's a Barian card, in order to win this Duel...

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.560
I have no choice but to use this.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.230
But Yuma...!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.860
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Limited Barian's Force!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:34.070
This card raises the rank of one Xyz Monster on my field by one,

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:39.370
and evolves it into a Chaos Xyz Monster one rank higher!

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:44.540
I rebuild the Overlay Network with Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.870
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.460
Target the Power of Chaos and aim for victory!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:54.210
The evolved gallant figure will now appear before us!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.760
Show yourself, Chaos Number 39!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.020
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray V!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:19.570
Hope Ray V... So this is Hope's evolved form...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.540
Even if you ranked it up, its Attack Power is still only 2600.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.170
It's no match for the 3800 Attack Power Babylon!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.790
We'll see about that. I activate Hope Ray V's effect!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.380
Once per turn, I detach one Overlay Unit,

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.720
and destroy one Monster on the field!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.650
And I inflict its Attack Power as damage to my opponent!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:55.440
Go, Hope Ray V! Destroy Babylon!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.490
V Blade Shoot!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:22.840
Now let's go! I use Hope Ray V to attack Pro Umimi directly!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.140
Hope Sword V-Shaped Slash!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.580
Heck yeah!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.000
They did it! Yay! Yay!

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.050
Are you all right, Honey?

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.720
Y-Yes...

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.430
Thank you, Darling.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.430
What's the matter?

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.270
It's rare to see you so worked up...

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:14.150
I'm sorry. During the Duel, I suddenly felt my head heat up.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.690
Goodness. Why'd I do that to Anna?

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.440
We did it, Yuma!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.700
Y-Yeah...

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.370
Eh? Don't quit Dueling?

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.790
Of course! No matter what happens,

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.120
I'll never quit Dueling.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:34.830
No way...

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:38.250
I'm just taking a little break, is all.

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.550
But why?

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.680
It's because of the proof of our love.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:48.050
Eh?! Could it be a baby?!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.600
Big Sis Umimi...

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.770
I didn't know anything about that.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:21:01.900
Sorry. It's not like I was trying to hide it from you.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:08.160
But thanks to that, I got to enjoy myself in a Duel with you today, Anna-<i>chan</i>.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.660
Me too.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:15.370
I'm happy you finally understood the true meaning of that card, Anna-<i>chan</i>.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:20.340
Th-That was... uh...

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.880
Go on. Direct Attack him with your love!

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.600
W-W-Wait! I'm falling! I'm falling!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.740
<i>Limited Barian's Force...</i>

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:49.700
<i>A card that evolves Hope into Hope Ray V...</i>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:56.460
<i>The coming battles against Barian
 are bound to get more intense...</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.750
<i>There has to be massive battle potential hidden within it...</i>

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.250
<i>So what is this?</i>

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:08.300
<i>What is... this uneasiness that some mysterious unknown force is about to appear...?</i>

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:24.570
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:32.280
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:39.880
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:47.220
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.760 --> 00:23:04.150
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.950
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:27.840
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:32.640
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:38.930
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:44.440
The sky splits open as a mysterious figure emerges!

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.820
Yuma and his friends are assaulted by a mysterious light!

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:49.900
And the person who appeared from that light was...!

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:51.740
What's with that light?!

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:53.490
The Gold Key Number?!

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:55.240
Our Rank-Up was sealed?!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.660
If this keeps up, Hope Ray V will...!

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:59.580
Yuma, that card...!

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:01.920
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:04.710
"Shingetsu's Crisis! The Attack of Vector the Manipulator!"

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:07.550
You're the Barian from before!
